#. * Followed by a text entry box for the user name.
#. 
#: plugins/audioscrobbler/rb-audioscrobbler-radio-source.c:75
msgid "Recommendations for User:"
msgstr "వాడుకరికి సిఫారసుచేయబడినవి:"

