#. * Followed by a text entry box for the tag.
#. 
#: plugins/audioscrobbler/rb-audioscrobbler-radio-source.c:84
msgid "Tracks Tagged with:"
msgstr "దీనితో టాగ్ చేసిన పాటలు:"

